(The State of Remote Work: 2026 Annual Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Executive Overview) Tj
T*
(Remote work has moved from an emergency measure to a permanent fixture) Tj
T*
(of knowledge work. This report surveys 1,200 companies across 14) Tj
T*
(countries to understand how distributed teams operate in 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Key Findings) Tj
T*
(Sixty-eight percent of surveyed firms now maintain a hybrid policy,) Tj
T*
(up from 41 percent in 2023. Fully remote firms fell to 12 percent,) Tj
T*
(while fully in-office arrangements held steady at 20 percent.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
