(Productivity Outcomes) Tj
T*
(Managers reported a 7 percent increase in output per employee, though) Tj
T*
(the effect varies sharply by function. Engineering and design roles) Tj
T*
(showed gains, while sales teams reported a 4 percent decline.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Real Estate Impact) Tj
T*
(Median office footprint shrank by 31 percent. Firms that renewed) Tj
T*
(leases negotiated an average of 18 percent lower rent per square foot.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
