/F1 12 Tf
72 720 Td
14 TL
(Recommendations) Tj
T*
(First, standardise a written hybrid policy rather than leaving) Tj
T*
(arrangements to individual managers. Second, invest in asynchronous) Tj
T*
(documentation before expanding headcount across time zones. Third,) Tj
T*
(measure outcomes instead of hours, and publish those metrics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Conclusion) Tj
T*
(The organisations that succeed are those that treat remote work as an) Tj
T*
(operating model to be designed, not a perk to be granted.) Tj
T*
ET
